# Regression scene (test/run/m5.sh "scenes"): the Hazard Course crate.
# t0a0a's func_pushable #156 (*67, x 1392..1456, y -1048..-984 in the map
# file) stands 40 u east of the pit (x 1248..1352, floor -256). Walking
# into it from the east pushes it off the ledge; it falls and rests on the
# pit floor against the west wall. GoldSrc (fixture
# physics-movetypes/P-botpush t0a0a walk_0, the fake client running at it
# from 1475 -1016 -135): box x 1248.03..1314.03, bottom -255.97, from
# frame 124 (1.24 s); like GoldSrc's, hl64's box is the model's bounds 1 u
# wider on every side (66 u), origin about (-143, 0, -83). Its top then
# lies 17.97 u under the floor, within a step: the player put on it walks
# west out of the pit onto the floor (origin z -136). Before
# engine/phys/pmove.c handed an impact touch the velocity the player hit
# with, the head-on clipped velocity (0) reached CPushable::Touch and the
# crate never moved; with the file's 64 u box its top lay 19.97 u down,
# no step (the player stays in the pit).
startmap t0a0a
waitmap t0a0a 60
god 1
setpos 1475 -1016 -135 0 180
wait 1
+forward
waitclass func_pushable -143 0 -83 0.5 6
-forward
wait 0.2
setpos 1290 -1016 -150 0 180
wait 0.5
+forward
waitnear 1200 -1016 -136 24 3
-forward
wait 0.2
pass
